{'symbol': 'PLD', 'date': '2022-08-31 08:37:00', 'title': 'PROLOGIS, L.P. COMMENCES EXCHANGE OFFERS FOR DUKE REALTY NOTES', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO , AUG. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PROLOGIS, INC. (NYSE: PLD; "PLD" ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT PLD\'S OPERATING PARTNERSHIP, PROLOGIS, L.P. ("PROLOGIS OP"), COMMENCED OFFERS TO EXCHANGE OUTSTANDING NOTES (THE "DUKE REALTY NOTES") OF THE NINE SERIES DESCRIBED IN THE TABLE BELOW ISSUED BY DUKE REALTY LIMITED PARTNERSHIP ("DUKE REALTY OP") FOR NOTES IN NINE CORRESPONDING SERIES TO BE ISSUED BY PROLOGIS OP (THE "PROLOGIS NOTES") IN THE AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF UP TO $3.375 BILLION.'}